        "type": "practiceLevel2",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145428,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operatore memorizza il risultato di un confronto in una variabile?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\" iscode=\"false\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>=</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>===</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>&lt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145429,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale operatore dobbiamo usare per verificare se la <code>health</code> di un giocatore sul lato sinistro dell'istruzione è minore o uguale a <code>0</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&gt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145430,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salva il risultato del confronto in <code>levelCleared</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"320\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minScore = \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelCleared = score &gt;= minScore;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelCleared);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>levelCleared</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>score &gt;= minScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145431,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fai in modo che questo codice visualizzi <code>true</code> nella console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLevel = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerLevel &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145432,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica se <code>score</code> è maggiore o uguale a <code>minScore</code> con l'operatore maggiore o uguale.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minScore = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelCleared = score &gt;= minScore;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelCleared);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145433,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"&quot;Run&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>RunRun</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145434,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa un operatore di confronto per confrontare <code>enemyType</code> con <code>expected</code> in modo che nella console venga visualizzato <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"&quot;orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" expected = \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyType === expected);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145435,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>!==</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Controlla se una stringa non è uguale a un'altra stringa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Controlla se una stringa è uguale a un'altra stringa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Verifica se una stringa è minore di un'altra stringa</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Controlla se una stringa non è uguale a un'altra stringa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145436,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica che <code>\"Sword\"</code> non sia uguale a <code>\"Shield\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145437,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>result</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145438,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variabile <code>const</code> che contenga un numero.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>coins</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145439,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salva il valore <code>101</code> nella variabile <code>const</code><code>totalScore</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalScore = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const totalScore</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145440,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di che tipo è <code>message</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Has key: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hasKey;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">String</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Boolean</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Numero</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere String.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145441,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salva il valore <code>\"1001\"</code> nella variabile <code>result</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"100\"</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145442,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Double jump enabled: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La stringa <code>\"Double jump enabled: true\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il booleano <code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La stringa <code>\"Double jump enabled: \"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La stringa <code>\"Double jump enabled: true\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145443,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I giocatori possono accedere al livello successivo se <em>non</em> hanno impostato <code>gameOver</code> su <code>true</code>. Usa un operatore per verificare se il giocatore può continuare.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameOver = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" canContinue = !gameOver; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can continue? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + canContinue);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145444,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la differenza tra <code>&amp;&amp;</code> e <code>||</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code> restituisce <code>true</code> solo quando tutte le condizioni sono <code>true</code>, <code>||</code> restituisce <code>true</code> quando almeno una condizione è <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code> non restituisce mai <code>true</code>, mentre <code>||</code> lo fa sempre</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code> non restituisce mai <code>false</code>, mentre <code>||</code> lo fa sempre</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&amp;&amp;</code> restituisce <code>true</code> solo quando tutte le condizioni sono <code>true</code>, <code>||</code> restituisce <code>true</code> quando almeno una condizione è <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 145445,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"43\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shieldEnergy = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = (playerHealth &gt; \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") &amp;&amp; (shieldEnergy &gt; \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"); \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Errore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 145446,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica se il gioco funziona correttamente. Il gioco va bene se gli FPS sono stabili <em>oppure</em> il giocatore non vede glitch.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fpsStable = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" noGlitches = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = fpsStable || noGlitches; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game ok? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fpsStable</code>, seguito da <code>||</code> e infine <code>noGlitches</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 145447,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Controlla se l'articolo è disponibile nell'inventario.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isSlotEmpty = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isAvailable = !isSlotEmpty; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isAvailable);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
